{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"yi-long","name":"Yi Long","birthDate":"1987-04-01","birthPlace":"Dezhou, Shandong, China","bio":"Chinese kickboxer, film and television actor, and ambassador of Dongxing-ASEAN sports and martial arts. Yilong, whose real name is Liu Xingjun, was born in Dezhou City, Shandong Province. In 2008, he won the championship of the Guangdong Foshan International Wing Chun Boxing and Hands (75kg) Championship  , and was rated as \"the most influential person in online media sports\" by the media for four consecutive years, and was rated as \"the most valuable person\" for many times. In 2009, he participated in the martial arts style of Henan Satellite TV and boarded the free fighting arena. In 2016, he won the WLF Chinese Wushu Best Contribution Award and the United Nations Peace Charity Award.","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-16T12:18:07+00:00","tmdbId":1779513,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/1779513","credits":[{"id":"civil-war","title":"Captain America: Civil War","character":"Super Soldier #2"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/yi-long.webp","filmography":[{"name":"Longmen Town","year":2023,"character":"","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/3d5zsajWvnFxrrQ08dS5Nc48Vs4.jpg"},{"name":"Invisible Tattoo","year":2022,"character":"","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/o9KJmNTMM9wlWFZ8yTEgewxS2sE.jpg"},{"name":"The Tai Chi Master","year":2022,"character":"Clan Di Leader","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/y4BAHmnJzP6QxyWyPUdVJkVYMCE.jpg"},{"name":"方世玉之胜者为王","year":2021,"character":"","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/10hkLP6nj9nBPiZv95xtvSqzNL5.jpg"},{"name":"Copper Skin and Iron Bones of Fang Shiyu","year":2021,"character":"Erdo","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/4iJ1aMCZNNYWyqmtUQ7J33P5Fns.jpg"},{"name":"Battle of Chinatown","year":2020,"character":"","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://ima